  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">222265_FY24_WFP_Sudan_South Kordofan_GFD_A3</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Goal: To save lives through improved food and nutrition status of children being boys and girls and pregnant and lactating women whilst restoring livelihoods and enhancing communities resilience to shocks amongst the vulnerable Internally Displaced Persons, refugees and host population in South Kordofan.
 
 The project goal aligns with WFP Sudan Country Strategic outcomes
 
 - Strategic Outcome 1, which states that people affected by shocks in targeted areas have access to food nutrition and livelihoods during after crises. 
 
 - Strategic Outcome 2: which states that food-insecure residents in targeted areas have sustainable improved nutrition by 2024</narrative>
  </description>
